# Vue Mobile Starter - Cursor Rules

> 详细规则请查看 `.cursor/rules/` 目录

## Project Overview
Vue 3 移动端项目脚手架，使用 Vant 4 UI 组件库，支持移动端适配。

## Tech Stack
- Vue 3.4+ with `<script setup lang="ts">`
- Vite 5+ build tool
- TypeScript 5+ (strict mode)
- Vant 4 UI library
- Sass (scoped) + PostCSS px-to-viewport
- Pinia state management
- Vue Router 4
- Vitest + @vue/test-utils

## Code Style

### Components
- Use `<script setup lang="ts">` only
- Props must use `withDefaults` + TypeScript interface
- Events must use `defineEmits` with types
- No `any` types allowed

### Styling
- Use `<style lang="scss" scoped>`
- Reference design tokens from docs/design-tokens.md
- Use `:deep()` for Vant overrides
- px auto-converts to vw via PostCSS

### State
- Pinia for global state
- ref/reactive for local state
- Never modify store directly, use actions

### API
- All requests from src/api/
- Use shared axios wrapper
- Define request/response types

## Naming Conventions
- Components: PascalCase (UserCard.vue)
- Composables: camelCase with use (useAuth.ts)
- Utils: camelCase (formatDate.ts)
- Types: PascalCase (User.ts)
- Stores: camelCase with Store (authStore.ts)
- CSS: kebab-case ($bg-color)

## Project Structure
src/
├── api/          # API requests
├── components/   # Shared components
├── composables/  # Vue composables
├── layouts/      # Layout components
├── pages/        # Page components
├── stores/       # Pinia stores
├── styles/       # Global styles
├── types/        # TypeScript types
└── utils/        # Utility functions

## Important Rules

### DO
- Use Vant built-in components
- Check VueUse before writing custom composables
- Write unit tests
- Use Conventional Commits

### DON'T
- Use console.log (use logger)
- Manipulate DOM directly
- Inline complex template logic
- Async in setup() (use onMounted)
- Hardcode pixels or colors